{% comment %}
  The heaviest-lifting section on the page (Primal Queen's "ancestors" block, translated).
  1. The enemy: everything in the cupboard that gave warmth that faded.
  2. Forgiveness: none of it failed because her joints are too far gone.
  3. The belief: warmth only helps a stiff joint if it stays. The ten minutes was the problem, not the heat.
  4. The mechanism only Jointwell has on the page: held level, strapped on, cordless, switches off.
  Replaces the old "That's not on you" and "How Jointwell works" sections.
{% endcomment %}
{%- assign p = all_products['jointwell-heated-joint-wrap'] -%}
<section class="jw-belief jw-band" id="jw-why-it-works">
  <div class="jw-wrap">
    <div class="jw-belief__top jw-narrow">
      <h2 class="jw-h2">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      <ul class="jw-belief__enemies" role="list">
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          {%- if block.type == 'enemy' -%}
            <li {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <strong>{{ block.settings.lead | escape }}</strong>
              {%- if block.settings.rest != blank %} <span>{{ block.settings.rest | escape }}</span>{% endif -%}
            </li>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
      <p class="jw-lead jw-belief__turn">{{ section.settings.turn | escape }}</p>
      <p class="jw-body">{{ section.settings.belief | escape }}</p>
      <p class="jw-body jw-belief__bridge"><strong>{{ section.settings.bridge | escape }}</strong></p>
    </div>

    {%- assign step_n = 0 -%}
    <ol class="jw-howto__steps jw-belief__steps" role="list">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- if block.type == 'step' -%}
          {%- assign step_n = step_n | plus: 1 -%}
          <li class="jw-card jw-howto__step" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
              {{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'jw-howto__img', alt: block.settings.title }}
            {%- elsif p != blank and p.images[block.settings.product_image_index] != blank -%}
              {{ p.images[block.settings.product_image_index] | image_url: width: 800 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'jw-howto__img', alt: block.settings.title }}
            {%- elsif block.settings.stock != 'none' -%}
              <img class="jw-howto__img" src="{{ block.settings.stock | asset_url }}" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" alt="">
            {%- endif -%}
            <p class="jw-howto__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ step_n }}</p>
            <h3 class="jw-h3">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</h3>
            <p class="jw-body">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</p>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ol>

    <p class="jw-body jw-narrow jw-belief__only">{{ section.settings.only_line | escape }}</p>
    <div class="jw-narrow">
      {% render 'jw-cta-strip', link: section.settings.cta_link, label: section.settings.cta_label %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "JW Why it works",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "jw-section-belief",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "You have tried everything in the cupboard. That's not on you."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "turn",
      "label": "The turn (bold)",
      "default": "None of them failed because your joints are too far gone. They failed because every one of them gives you warmth that fades."
    },
    {
      "type": "textarea",
      "id": "belief",
      "label": "The belief",
      "default": "A stiff joint doesn't want a blast of heat. It wants warmth that stays, long enough for the muscles round it to let go and the joint to move. The physio knows that, which is why she warms it before she touches it. The wheat bag knows it too, for ten minutes, and then it is a cold lump on your knee. The ten minutes was the problem. Not the heat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "bridge",
      "label": "Bridge line (bold)",
      "default": "So the whole job was to make warmth stay put, on the joint, for half an hour, without a wire or a microwave. That's all Jointwell is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "only_line",
      "label": "Line under the three steps",
      "default": "Nothing else in the cupboard does all four: holds a level, strapped on, cordless, and switches itself off. That's the difference, and it is the only claim we make."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "cta_label",
      "label": "Button text",
      "default": "Try it for 90 days"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "cta_link",
      "label": "Button link"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "enemy",
      "name": "Thing she tried",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lead",
          "label": "Bold lead",
          "default": "The wheat bag helps for ten minutes."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "rest",
          "label": "Rest of the line",
          "default": "Then it is cold and you're back at the microwave for the fourth time tonight."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "step",
      "name": "Mechanism step",
      "limit": 3,
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Photo"
        },
        {
          "type": "range",
          "id": "product_image_index",
          "label": "Or product photo number",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 9,
          "step": 1,
          "default": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "select",
          "id": "stock",
          "label": "Or built-in photo",
          "default": "jw-feature-heat.jpg",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "jw-feature-heat.jpg",
              "label": "Heat levels"
            },
            {
              "value": "jw-feature-massage.jpg",
              "label": "Massage"
            },
            {
              "value": "jw-feature-timer.jpg",
              "label": "Timer"
            },
            {
              "value": "jw-feature-joints.jpg",
              "label": "Knee, shoulder, elbow"
            },
            {
              "value": "jw-feature-weight.jpg",
              "label": "360 g"
            },
            {
              "value": "none",
              "label": "No photo"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Title",
          "default": "Warmth, held at the level you set"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Text",
          "default": "Five levels from 45°C to 65°C. Pick one and it stays there for the whole session, instead of starting hot and fading like a wheat bag."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "JW Why it works",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "enemy",
          "settings": {
            "lead": "The wheat bag helps for ten minutes.",
            "rest": "Then it is cold and you are back at the microwave for the fourth time tonight."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "enemy",
          "settings": {
            "lead": "The cream warms the skin, not the joint.",
            "rest": "Three times a day, and it comes off on your trousers."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "enemy",
          "settings": {
            "lead": "The heated pad ties you to a socket.",
            "rest": "Warm, but you sit where the wire lets you, and there is no level to hold."
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "enemy",
          "settings": {
            "lead": "The pills work until they wear off.",
            "rest": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "enemy",
          "settings": {
            "lead": "The physio helps for a few days.",
            "rest": "Then the stiffness comes back, £50 a visit, next appointment three weeks off."
